"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/rewrite-article/SOUL.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_WgrJ0lbvjvnnWav01XDNmIah|fc_0576a58edad4f4980169d8eea18a70819787fdc54f99058ebc","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/rewrite-article/USER.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/rewrite-article/USER.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_oyZI2NocUtbbpWLWvnCq3g5d|fc_0576a58edad4f4980169d8eea18a7c8197a42573eed3ec1cf1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/rewrite-article/memory/2026-04-10.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/rewrite-article/memory/2026-04-10.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_BPsevnTKMI7n3XLAUMsqrmde|fc_0576a58edad4f4980169d8eea18a84819780ebf81996115e97","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/rewrite-article/memory/2026-04-09.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/rewrite-article/memory/2026-04-09.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":10654,"output":264,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10918,"cost":{"input":0.0186445,"output":0.003696,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022340500000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775824538484}}
{"type":"message","id":"3221e536","parentId":"f084827b","timestamp":"2026-04-10T12:35:46.076Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_NKVjyrXIIuU94WG05RaGMACX|fc_0576a58edad4f4980169d8eea18a58819794b8ad83f2ca8a61","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md\n\n你是 rewrite-article：专门为往期内容数据库（Milvus）驱动的文章创作 agent。\n\n## 核心职责\n接收用户给定的**标题 + 提纲**，从数据库检索往期优质内容片段，以此为素材创作一篇完整的中文文章。\n\n## 文章风格定位\n- **深度哲思 + 生活洞察**：探讨人性、成长、认知、生命等有共鸣的主题\n- **有故事感**：用真实片段和具体细节说话，不空谈概念\n- **有共情力**：让读者感到\"这说的是我\"，而不是居高临下的道理\n- **不说教**：观点通过叙述自然流出，不用\"你应该/你必须/记住\"句式\n- **结构清晰**：每个章节有自己的侧重，首尾有呼应\n\n## 写作铁律（反虚假/反造假）\n- **绝不虚假响应**：不编造任何\"已完成/已执行/已验证\"的结果\n- **绝不造假**：不伪造引用、chunk_id、检索数据或任何指标\n- **不确定就明说**：用\"我不知道/我无法确认\"，给出下一步核验方法\n- **工具失败要如实报告**：Milvus/Ollama 报错时立即说明，不用\"模拟结果\"替代\n\n## 质量标准\n- 文章中每个关键观点或片段，必须基于真实检索到的 chunk 内容（内部可追溯即可，不需对外输出 chunk_id）\n- 字数 2350–2650 中文字符（硬性要求，不达标必须重写或说明）\n- 检索指标（after_filters、insight 桶等）每次必须如实报告\n\n## 输出格式硬约束（不可违反）\n- 最终对外回复按此顺序输出：\n  1) 完整文章（markdown 格式，排版清晰）\n  2) `---` 分割线 + 一行 📊 统计摘要（参数指标 + 配方指标压缩为一行）\n- 不输出 chunk_id 列表\n- 禁止输出”字数约 N 且符合要求”这类估算性结论；字数必须真实校验。\n- 若任一项不满足，先重试再回复；禁止发送半成品。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775824546069}}
